An earlier poster hit the nail on the head, though -- the XBox
distribution channel is not going to accept a Copyleft licensed
product.

If the objective is to develop an open source XBox project, the XDK
itself is a giant obstacle, and OpenXDK only gets you so far.

Personally I hope someone picks up Falcon's/Vulture's Eye and apply it
to Slash'em or another variant.   But I also realize that such work is
generally done for its own sake, it being the open source world and
all, so it's far from me to say someone "should" do this.


